{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>《習慣打卡》是一款專為建立日常節奏而設的習慣追蹤工具，支援多種記錄方式、Apple 健康同步、專注計時器與小工具；無論你想養成新習慣、戒掉壞習慣，還是回顧長期表現，它都能提供清晰數據。目前這款 App 正在終生版限時免費，原價 US $2.99，適合所有希望透過每日行動改變生活的人。</p>\n\n<h2>值得下載的亮點</h2>\n<p>「今天」視圖把每日目標、完成率與快速記錄集中在一個清爽面板，支援打勾、次數、時長或數值記錄；亦可連接 Apple 健康，自動同步步數、睡眠與飲水，並以連續記錄護盾守護你的堅持。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-154-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-155-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-156-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-157-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-158-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-159-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<h2>限時免費領取終生版</h2>\n<p>《 習慣打卡》 終生版內購限時免費中，用戶完成初始化後，進入設定，下方可找到「一次性購買」，選取後看到收費牆，Lifetime 價格顯示為$0 即可免費收下。注意，如果看到價格不是 $0 代表限免已完結，請勿按付費確認。</p>\n<img alt=\"IMG 4695\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/IMG_4695-473x1024.webp\"/>\n<img alt=\"IMG 4697\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/IMG_4697-473x1024.webp\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：習慣打卡：日常與目標</li>\n<li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-06T09:00:04.710965+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":409,"images":8,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}